{"parse": {"title": "吼吼自选衣箱·聚合浪潮", "pageid": 144209, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"吼吼自选衣箱·聚合浪潮\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5f/Item-713201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"吼吼自选衣箱·聚合浪潮\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>吼吼自选衣箱·聚合浪潮</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#713851</div></div><hr /><div>由“告别安宁夜”社团臻选、量身定制、别具匠心的衣箱，开启后可自选一件指定范围内的衣着（该衣箱自选范围截至3.0~3.4版本的吼吼点唱机衣着）。若在已拥有、未使用该衣箱的情况下，拥有衣箱内所有衣着，则使用衣箱将自动退还1360辉光丝。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">别出新意，抑或低调从容？亲爱的，这儿的每一件衣裳——都在静静等待你的垂青。嘈杂的乐音和窸窣声已经压抑不住，请不要冷落它们。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"308804\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F\" title=\"衣着/心之盈亏\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F\" title=\"心之盈亏\"><img alt=\"心之盈亏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Item_heroskin-308804.png/100px-Item_heroskin-308804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Item_heroskin-308804.png/150px-Item_heroskin-308804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Item_heroskin-308804.png/200px-Item_heroskin-308804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%83%E4%B9%8B%E7%9B%88%E4%BA%8F\" title=\"衣着/心之盈亏\">心之盈亏</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">向万变的月，展露不变的信念。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"305104\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B2\" title=\"衣着/以黄金哺育\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B2\" title=\"以黄金哺育\"><img alt=\"以黄金哺育\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Item_heroskin-305104.png/100px-Item_heroskin-305104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Item_heroskin-305104.png/150px-Item_heroskin-305104.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Item_heroskin-305104.png/200px-Item_heroskin-305104.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BB%A5%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E5%93%BA%E8%82%B2\" title=\"衣着/以黄金哺育\">以黄金哺育</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">一千粒灿烂的黄金，落入温暖宽厚的怀抱。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"300731\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92\" title=\"衣着/魂灵长青\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92\" title=\"魂灵长青\"><img alt=\"魂灵长青\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Item_heroskin-300731.png/100px-Item_heroskin-300731.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Item_heroskin-300731.png/150px-Item_heroskin-300731.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Item_heroskin-300731.png/200px-Item_heroskin-300731.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E9%AD%82%E7%81%B5%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92\" title=\"衣着/魂灵长青\">魂灵长青</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">当墓碑覆上绿色，生命再一次战胜了命运。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"308004\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"衣着/时代病陪护\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"时代病陪护\"><img alt=\"时代病陪护\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Item_heroskin-308004.png/100px-Item_heroskin-308004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Item_heroskin-308004.png/150px-Item_heroskin-308004.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Item_heroskin-308004.png/200px-Item_heroskin-308004.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%AA%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"衣着/时代病陪护\">时代病陪护</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">她不顾一切地伸出援手，尽管啊，尽管。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"304704\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%B0%B8%E7%94%9F%E8%8B%A6%E7%9F%AD\" title=\"衣着/永生苦短\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%B0%B8%E7%94%9F%E8%8B%A6%E7%9F%AD\" title=\"永生苦短\"><img alt=\"永生苦短\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Item_heroskin-304704.png/100px-Item_heroskin-304704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Item_heroskin-304704.png/150px-Item_heroskin-304704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Item_heroskin-304704.png/200px-Item_heroskin-304704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%B0%B8%E7%94%9F%E8%8B%A6%E7%9F%AD\" title=\"衣着/永生苦短\">永生苦短</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">那些曾经轻轻舔舐我们的，为我们换来了永生的配方。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"310404\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%A3%81%E6%98%A5%E8%A1%AB\" title=\"衣着/裁春衫\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-f